ection \"The Twilight Kingdom\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"ice-age-on-the-world-of-magic-the-gathering-e3","era":{"date":"1995-06-03","era":"ice","label":"Ice Age"},"summary":"An explosion in Clan Emerald's quarters kills sixteen; Miko decrees a duel to the death between Jason and Freyalise.","participants":["miko","hurn","jason-carthalion","freyalise"],"location":"storgard","importance":"major","page":"wiki/ice-age-on-the-world-of-magic-the-gathering","order":1908,"story_date":"","storyline":"Ice Age","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":6,"quote":"But Miko decrees that a magical duel must decide the conflict.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ice_Age_on_the_World_of_Magic%3A_The_Gathering#:~:text=But%20Miko%20decrees%20that,must%20decide%20the%20conflict.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Ice Age on the World of Magic: The Gathering","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ice_Age_on_the_World_of_Magic%3A_The_Gathering","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ice_Age_on_the_World_of_Magic%3A_The_Gathering#:~:text=But%20Miko%20decrees%20that,must%20decide%20the%20conflict.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Ice Age on the World of Magic: The Gathering\", section \"The Twilight Kingdom\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"ice-age-on-the-world-of-magic-the-gathering-e7","era":{"date":"1995-06-03","era":"ice","label":"Ice Age"},"summary":"Forty days later Miko lets the Emerald and Pearl clans leave and Jason's group heads south.","participants":["miko","jason-carthalion","oriel-kjeldos","hurn","mariska"],"location":"storgard","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/ice-age-on-the-world-of-magic-the-gathering","order":1908,"story_date":"","storyline":"Ice Age","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":10,"quote":"Jason, Oriel, Mariska, Hurn, and four dozen other people start their walk to the south.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ice_Age_on_the_World_of_Magic%3A_The_Gathering#:~:text=Jason%2C%20Oriel%2C%20Mariska%2C%20Hurn%2C,walk%20to%20the%20south.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Ice Age on the World of Magic: The Gathering","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ice_Age_on_the_World_of_Magic%3A_The_Gathering","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Ice_Age_on_the_World_of_Magic%3A_The_Gathering#:~:text=Jason%2C%20Oriel%2C%20Mariska%2C%20Hurn%2C,walk%20to%20the%20south.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Ice Age on the World of Magic: The Gathering\", section \"The Twilight Kingdom\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"medge-e4","era":{"date":"2018-10-05","era":"grn","label":"Guilds of Ravnica"},"summary":"The students bring the ship to the zonot, where the ghost reveals his sinister form; Miko opens the chest, a fight follows, and Chessa tricks a krasis into swallowing the medallion, destroying the ghost.","participants":["andrik","miko","chessa"],"location":"zonot-five","importance":"major","page":"wiki/medge","order":2301,"story_date":"","storyline":"Guilds of Ravnica","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":7,"quote":"led the ghost to his demise by tricking a krasis into swallowing it","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge#:~:text=led%20the%20ghost%20to,krasis%20into%20swallowing%20it","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Medge","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge#:~:text=led%20the%20ghost%20to,krasis%20into%20swallowing%20it","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Medge\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"medge-e6","era":{"date":"2018-10-05","era":"grn","label":"Guilds of Ravnica"},"summary":"Miko accidentally causes a cytoplast to fall on Medge, starting her mutation; the class is imprisoned and then released through Zegana's intervention.","participants":["miko","medge","zegana","kaszira"],"location":"zonot-five","importance":"major","page":"wiki/medge","order":2301,"story_date":"","storyline":"Guilds of Ravnica","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":9,"quote":"initiating her mutation","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge#:~:text=initiating%20her%20mutation","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Medge","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Medge#:~:text=initiating%20her%20mutation","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Medge\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}},{"id":"principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06-e0","era":null,"summary":"Medge shows her students a motionless elder monk, and Kaszira calculates how long he has meditated from the plankton on him.","participants":["medge","kaszira","miko","chessa"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"minor","page":"stories/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","order":681,"story_date":"2019-02-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":10,"quote":"Seven weeks. That's how long the elder monk has been meditating.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=Seven%20weeks.%20That%27s%20how,monk%20has%20been%20meditating.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Principles of Unnatural Selection","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=Seven%20weeks.%20That%27s%20how,monk%20has%20been%20meditating.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Principles of Unnatural Selection\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06-e2","era":null,"summary":"Medge takes her eight students beyond the safe waters to watch a krasis in action, where they witness a krasis kill a resplendent benthid.","participants":["medge","krasis","resplendent-benthid","kaszira","miko","chessa"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","order":681,"story_date":"2019-02-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":35,"quote":"A stinger erupts from the tip of the krasis's tail and strikes a killing blow on the beast's soft underbelly.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=A%20stinger%20erupts%20from,the%20beast%27s%20soft%20underbelly.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Principles of Unnatural Selection","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=A%20stinger%20erupts%20from,the%20beast%27s%20soft%20underbelly.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Principles of Unnatural Selection\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06-e3","era":null,"summary":"A voice rasping 'passage' draws Medge, Kaszira and Miko into a wreck, where they find a ghost.","participants":["medge","kaszira","miko","andrik","heckless"],"location":"ravnica","importance":"major","page":"stories/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","order":681,"story_date":"2019-02-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":59,"quote":"The human locks eyes with Miko.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=The%20human%20locks%