s of Unnatural Selection","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=The%20old%20wreck%20fades,like%20the%20water%20itself.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Principles of Unnatural Selection\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06-e7","era":null,"summary":"At the zonot, Andrik panics, reveals himself as a pirate in opulent robes and unleashes a storm, and the trunk's contents prove to be stolen Simic treasure.","participants":["andrik","medge","miko","kaszira","chessa"],"location":"zonots","importance":"major","page":"stories/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","order":681,"story_date":"2019-02-06","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":100,"quote":"You stole these,\" I say. \"Your crew wasn't pontificating! You were pirating!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=You%20stole%20these%2C%22%20I,pontificating%21%20You%20were%20pirating%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Principles of Unnatural Selection","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Nicky Drayden"],"date":"2019-02-06","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06#:~:text=You%20stole%20these%2C%22%20I,pontificating%21%20You%20were%20pirating%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Principles of Unnatural Selection\" by Nicky Drayden. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 6 Feb 2019."}},{"id":"principles-unnatural-selection-2019-02-06-e11","era":null,"summary":"Miko's fin knocks the cytoplast from its pedestal